  "limitations": [
    "Scores are provisional browser judgments based on the attached screenshots, chronological still-frame filmstrips and supplied runtime summary; no additional files, source, prior rounds or other graders were inspected.",
    "Corresponding normal, enlarged and transition captures are grouped with each named screen state; filmstrips were inspected as still frames, not watched as video.",
    "Supplied runtime results support browser interaction scores but were not independently rerun during this evaluation.",
    "No hard-gate failure is established: content outside a captured viewport is not proof of an unreachable action, and supplied layout/editor checks report reachability and retained drafts.",
    "The browser A>=9 and F>=9 threshold is not met across all screens and components, particularly for scene transitions, dense explanations, outcome surfaces and enlarged URL fallback.",
    "Physical iPhone, VoiceOver, native keyboard, tilt, haptics, OS sharing, notifications and native performance remain deferred without deductions solely for that boundary; this report does not certify full/native 9/10.",
    "Connected Circles behavior, successful native voice input and real billing are not established by the represented browser states; billing and navigator.share are explicitly simulated.",
    "Fixture predictions and synthetic source text establish layout coverage only, not predictive accuracy, explanation quality or research validity.",
    "Browser timing claims come from the supplied separate measurements, not screenshot sampling; static artwork and filmstrips do not independently prove parallax or the provenance of painted layers."
  ],
  "topFixes": [
    "Remove delayed room-painting appearance and visible post-navigation settling so camera transitions connect complete scenes.",
    "Improve centered explanation scanning with short section labels, shorter paragraph groups and clearer spacing.",
    "Reduce oversized heading and preamble footprints at 200%, especially on Approach, check-in, birth profile and invitation results.",
    "Give outcome rows and expanded evidence panels material depth consistent with wood, writing paper and parchment.",
    "Strengthen internal-scroll, URL-selection and below-footer continuation cues in enlarged constrained forms.",
    "Increase the initial share preview’s usefulness and clarify the visual priority of forecast actions.",
    "Verify and document close/back browser target sizes and focus states explicitly."
  ]
}
